      "body": "Still figuring out the best fix, but posting the issue in the meantime.\n\nWhen pruning, we remove the pruned child from `m_blocks_unlinked`. When the missing parent arrives, `ReceivedBlockTransactions()` [uses `m_blocks_unlinked`](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/59224b66aa1db43adc61c15ee41b413951f22f80/src/validation.cpp#L3827-L3832) to find descendants and calculate their `m_chain_tx_count`. Because the child was removed during pruning, its `m_chain_tx_count` remains unset, causing the assertion failure.",
